   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SGU (Swedish Geological urvey) is leading MeetingPoints Mining shich is an initiative to stimulate sustainable prtnerships between Swedish private enterprise, public authorities, universities and other org in the mining sector and their counterparts in selected countries. MeetingPoints Mining has enabled SGU to establish networks and meeting points and to assume the role Facilitaor for the sector</narrative>
